                                text="&lt;p>Data collected through your interaction with us may be processed based on the products and services we offer, or if submitted by prospective employees to ensure applicants receive accurate job placement.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;p>AbbVie does not knowingly collect any Personal Data directly from children. All AbbVie relationships that support children are directed to and are communicated with parents and guardians only.&lt;/p>&#xd;&#xa;"
